      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks weird to me. The import refers to a dexjar that is already compiled. Why does it need \"compile_dex: true\"?\n\nI looked at [a typical java_sdk_library_import in a prebuilt module SDK](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:prebuilts/module_sdk/AdServices/current/Android.bp;l\u003d45;drc\u003d955dced2b42ef9cbfc5728a453daca523f9b25ce). It doesn\u0027t have \"compile_dex: true\". Does it still work after this change?",
